examples/bench.rs:137-146:
```rust
let mut ready = false;
for line in BufReader::new(stdout).lines() {
    if Instant::now() > deadline {
        break;
    }
    if let Ok(l) = line
        && l.contains("listening")
    {
        ready = true;
        break;
    }
}
```
deadline 검사는 `lines()`의 다음 blocking read 전에만 수행됨.
